summary: Regression test for bug 1767015
description: |
      This test is applicable to ppc64le powervm only
      It tests kdump service status after removing multiple LMB

      Accepted Parameters:
         - TESTARGS:
            add/remove multiple LMB (by default, 10 LMB = 2.5G)

         - LOOPCOUNT:
            The times of removing/adding LMB (by default 10 times)
contact: Kdump QE <kdump-qe-list@redhat.com>
test: make run
framework: shell
require:
  - kexec-tools
duration: 30m
extra-summary: /kernel/kdump/reg-bz1767015-mem-remove
extra-task: /kernel/kdump/reg-bz1767015-mem-remove
